{"uid":"bad421ae680e9f53","name":"test_a_separate_process_cannot_forge_an_exemption","fullName":"tests.test_petition_adjudications_run_scope#test_a_separate_process_cannot_forge_an_exemption","historyId":"a10da8fcda7c1a2c4ba3596629eb01a7","time":{"start":1791959620057,"stop":1791959620134,"duration":77},"description":"The threat model as it actually stands: a worker iteration is a\n    SEPARATE PROCESS from the engine (`runner.py` spawns the agent CLI), so\n    it can write every file in the run dir but cannot read the engine's\n    address space. This test runs the attempt-2 probe's full program in a\n    genuine subprocess -- edit the record, hunt the run dir for key\n    material, recompute both the documented unkeyed digest and a keyed MAC\n    under every candidate key it can find, append a matching\n    `petition_adjudications_recorded` witness line -- and the engine\n    process then reads the result as TAMPERED with no exemption granted.","descriptionHtml":"<p>The threat model as it actually stands: a worker iteration is a<br />\nSEPARATE PROCESS from the engine (<code>runner.py</code> spawns the agent CLI), so<br />\nit can write every file in the run dir but cannot read the engine's<br />\naddress space. This test runs the attempt-2 probe's full program in a<br />\ngenuine subprocess -- edit the record, hunt the run dir for key<br />\nmaterial, recompute both the documented unkeyed digest and a keyed MAC<br />\nunder every candidate key it can find, append a matching<br />\n<code>petition_adjudications_recorded</code> witness line -- and the engine<br />\nprocess then reads the result as TAMPERED with no exemption granted.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791959389075,"stop":1791959389075,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"